GPUI Liquid Glass, Chromium host and attached-NSApp patch for Ardia.

Base: zed-industries/zed a3ce8d5e88e35697b2ba1cf9cb3c6816089b8281, crates gpui, gpui_macos,
gpui_platform, gpui_windows and gpui_linux, vendored as third_party/gpui/<crate>. The Cargo.toml
files of that base are the ones the bootstrap commit f3502a2ed wrote (workspace dependencies
unrolled to explicit git and path dependencies), so the unrolling is not part of this patch.

Apply from the repository root onto pristine vendored crates: git apply patches/gpui-liquid-glass.patch

